      "writtenOn": "2023-04-11T13:57:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m nervous about it being missed in other configs, since DMA corruption is so horrible to debug and manifests as transient failures across the system. I figured it was better to default it to `y` (like we do for the other erratum workarounds in this Kconfig file) and have the cmdline option instead, which bootloaders can force `on` for affected devices.",
      "parentUuid": "b0a40d34_2b5df684",
